<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>{% title | default('API key demo') %}</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/style.css">
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <h1><a href="/">Punk::Plugin::APIKey</a></h1>
  <p class="lede">One keyword. Long-lived credentials that answer to their
  owner's current standing.</p>
</header>

<main>
{% content %}
</main>

<footer><small>The database is a file under var/, and the session key is
minted at boot - restarting the server signs everybody out and leaves the
keys where they are. Every key you mint here is real: it will authenticate
until you revoke it or drop the file.</small></footer>
</body>
</html>
